<h1>a/same</h1><p><strong>running</strong> · step 2 · updated <time data-time="[timestamp]">[age]</time> · trainer time 20s (last logged).</p><p class="dim">unknown · 2 records</p><dl class="metrics"><div><dt>loss</dt><dd>1</dd></div><div><dt>custom</dt><dd>0.75</dd></div><div><dt>Summary: latency</dt><dd>1 ms</dd></div></dl><div class="actions"><a href="#metadata">Metadata</a><a href="#benchmarks">Benchmarks</a></div><form id="chart-filters" class="filters"><input type="hidden" name="run" value="a/same"><fieldset><legend>Metrics and charts</legend><label>Filter metrics <input name="metric" list="metrics" autocomplete="off" placeholder="All metrics (e.g. loss)" value=""></label><datalist id="metrics"><option value="loss"></option><option value="custom"></option></datalist><label>Axis <select name="axis"><option value="auto" selected="">auto</option><option value="tokens">tokens</option><option value="flops">flops</option><option value="step">step</option><option value="seconds">seconds</option><option value="time">time</option></select></label><button>Apply</button></fieldset><details id="chart-options"><summary>Smoothing, range and seed groups</summary><fieldset><label>Smoothing method <select name="smoothing"><option value="auto" selected="">Auto (loss Gaussian)</option><option value="gaussian">Gaussian</option><option value="raw">Raw</option><option value="mean">Trailing mean</option><option value="ema">EMA</option></select></label><label>Mean / EMA span <input type="number" name="smooth" min="1" max="100" value="20"></label><label>Seed groups <input type="checkbox" name="group" value="1"></label><label>Gaussian bandwidth (% of shared axis range) <input type="number" name="bandwidth" min="0.5" max="10" step="0.1" value="2"></label><label>From <input type="number" step="any" name="start" value=""></label><label>To <input type="number" step="any" name="end" value=""></label></fieldset><p class="dim">Auto shows loss against tokens seen when all runs have token history, with raw loss under a centered Gaussian overlay; other metrics use steps and raw values. Gaussian bandwidth is its standard deviation in axis distance (default 2% of the selected runs' shared full retained axis range), not observation count. Both sides contribute; new data can revise the curve, and its relative bandwidth grows with the shared axis range. EMA uses alpha = 2 / (span + 1), seeded from the first observation; span 1 is raw. Tokens sums reported train/real_tokens windows only with complete history, or uses cumulative train/tokens_seen. FLOPs requires cumulative train/flops_total; it is not estimated. Table summaries are unchanged.</p></details><p class="dim">Search any reported metric by substring, ignoring case. Each page shows up to 32 metrics; Next metrics shows the rest. Loss, step timing and throughput appear first, then other metrics alphabetically within each group.</p></form><div class="actions metric-navigation"><span>2 matching metrics shown</span></div><figure data-key="loss%7Ca%2Fsame"><figcaption>loss <span class="dim">· Gaussian overlay · faint: raw</span><span class="dim" data-chart-state=""></span></figcaption><div class="legend"><span data-colour="0" title="a/same" aria-label="a/same" tabindex="0"><b>1</b><span class="legend-name"><span class="legend-prefix">same</span><span class="legend-suffix"></span></span></span></div><svg class="plot" role="img" width="984" height="252" viewBox="0 0 984 252" aria-label="loss by step"><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="196" y2="196" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="200" text-anchor="end">1</text><text data-x-tick="0" x="60" y="218" text-anchor="start">1</text><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="151" y2="151" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="155" text-anchor="end">1.75</text><text data-x-tick="0.25" x="285" y="218" text-anchor="middle">1.25</text><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="106" y2="106" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x